  "changes": [
    "Independent training and matching selection for budgets 1, 2, and 3; no bundled pretrained weights",
    "One YAML config and explicit WSI preprocessing stages plus complete-pipeline entry point",
    "Separate pinned environments for UNI2-h/ReSCOPE and CellViT",
    "CellViT patch row=y/col=x, global centroids and contours=xy, bounding boxes=row_col, aligned with pinned upstream",
    "New preprocessing configs record exact integer tile pitch and full grid shape; old configs without these fields retain prior geometry behavior",
    "Optional original HD bin-assignment/aggregation functions with a direct-path interface; no historical dataset-manifest workflow",
    "Synthetic preprocessing and input-to-ROI integration tests; no claim of full-slide GPU validation"
  ],
